From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:49:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Implement the system functions picolibc leaves to the
 platform

picolibc's malloc grows the heap with sbrk, which keeps moving from
MEM1 into MEM2. stdin, stdout and stderr are a stream to the Dolphin
debug UART, which SYS_Report also writes to. _exit, nanosleep and
usleep take the place of the newlib hooks, abort crashes with a trap
for the red screen, and build_argv and __crtmain start main.
---
